Package: sharkyIBM
Title: Simulate Populations Of Animals
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("John", "Swenson", , "swensonjohnd@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Individual-based simulation of age-structured animal populations
    with full parentage tracking, Markov breeding cycles, and hierarchical
    sampling schemes. Designed to ground-truth close-kin mark-recapture
    (CKMR) estimators for marine mammals, particularly dolphins.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
